## CQ-PWG-28-tab | creative inventory: P10 entries in the Power Grid tab
key e
sleep 2
shot creative_inv
look Power Grid tab (page arrows if needed): copper plating, slab, stairs, ceiling tile and the string light cord after the copper cord; no attachment blocks, no string_light_block; hover the plain and the patterned cord by hand ("Pattern:" with three coloured O, 120 V / 3 W lines). JEI (by hand, search box): copper_plating R deploying / U stonecutting, crafting, design table, solar panel bearing; string_light_cord R deploying; ceiling_tile R deploying with an empty cardboard slot (D13)
key Escape
sleep 1

